{"title":"Python爬虫进阶：urllib请求对象定制与UA伪装","slug":"2024-07-26-urllib_请求对象的定制","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-urllib_请求对象的定制.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在使用 Python 进行网络爬虫开发时，<code>urllib</code> 库是我们最常接触的基础库。很多初学者在使用 <code>urllib.request.urlopen</code> 时会发现：直接请求往往无法获取网页数据，或者被服务器重定向到登录页/错误页。</p>\n<p>这通常是因为我们忽略了 <strong>请求头</strong> 的设置。本文将深入讲解如何通过 <code>urllib</code> 定制请求对象，实现 UA 伪装，以及如何处理 URL 中的中文编码问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一、基础知识：URL-的组成与端口\"><a href=\"#一、基础知识：URL-的组成与端口\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、基础知识：URL 的组成与端口\"></a>一、基础知识：URL 的组成与端口</h2><p>在深入代码之前，我们需要理解 URL 的基本构成。一个完整的 URL 包含协议、主机、端口号、路径、参数和锚点。</p>\n<p>在爬虫请求中，<strong>端口号</strong> 往往决定了协议类型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">协议类型</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">默认端口</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>HTTP</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">80</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">超文本传输协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>HTTPS</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">443</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">安全套接字层超文本传输协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">MySQL</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">3306</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">数据库服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Redis</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">6379</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">缓存服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">MongoDB</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">27017</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">数据库服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>我们在代码中指定的 <code>https://www.baidu.com</code>，浏览器实际上默认连接的是 <code>443</code> 端口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\"><a href=\"#二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\"></a>二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？</h2><p><code>urlopen</code> 方法虽然简单，但它只接受 URL 字符串或特定的 Request 对象。</p>\n<p>如果我们直接发起请求，<code>urllib</code> 发送的请求头中的 <code>User-Agent</code> 默认是 <code>Python-urllib/x.x</code>。绝大多数网站会识别出这是一个脚本请求，从而通过反爬机制直接拒绝访问。</p>\n<p><strong>核心问题</strong>：<code>urlopen</code> 方法本身不支持直接传递 <code>headers</code> 字典参数。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：使用 <code>urllib.request.Request</code> 类定制请求对象，将 URL 和 Headers 封装在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三、实战演练\"><a href=\"#三、实战演练\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、实战演练\"></a>三、实战演练</h2><h3 id=\"1-基础案例：添加-User-Agent-伪装\"><a href=\"#1-基础案例：添加-User-Agent-伪装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 基础案例：添加 User-Agent 伪装\"></a>1. 基础案例：添加 User-Agent 伪装</h3><p>下面的代码展示了如何创建一个包含自定义 Headers 的请求对象，成功访问百度首页。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 目标 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 这是一个标准的浏览器 User-Agent，用于伪装成 Chrome 浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36 Edge/16.16299&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 请求对象的定制</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 因为 urlopen 不支持直接传 headers 字典，所以需要先构建 Request 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 关键词传参：将 url 和 headers 封装进 request 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取并解码响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码解析**：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **headers 构建**：我们从浏览器开发者工具中复制真实的 User-Agent 字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **Request 对象**：通过 `urllib.request.Request` 将 URL 和 Headers 绑定。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **发送请求**：`urlopen` 接收的是定制好的 `request` 对象，而非单纯的 URL 字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 进阶案例：URL 参数编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在实际爬虫中，我们经常需要搜索特定关键词（如中文）。URL 中如果包含中文或其他特殊字符，必须进行编码（Percent-encoding），否则会抛出错误或乱码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`urllib.parse.quote` 方法可以将字符串转换为 URL 兼容的编码格式。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.parse</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 基础 URL，注意 &#x27;wd&#x27; 是百度的查询参数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 需要查询的关键词</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">keyword = <span class=\"string\">&quot;你好&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># URL 编码转换</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 将中文 &quot;你好&quot; 转换为 Unicode 编码格式 (例如: %E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">name = urllib.parse.quote(keyword)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;编码后的关键词: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 拼接完整的 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">full_url = base_url + name</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定制请求对象 (复用之前的 headers)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=full_url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 发送请求并获取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\">**关键点说明**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `urllib.parse.quote(<span class=\"string\">&quot;你好&quot;</span>)`：将中文字符转换为 `%xx` 形式，这是 HTTP 协议传输的标准要求。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `full_url` 拼接：在爬虫开发中，构建带参数的 URL 是最常见的操作之一。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了 `urllib` 库中请求对象定制的关键技术：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  使用 `urllib.request.Request` 封装 URL 和 Headers，解决 `urlopen` 无法携带请求头的问题。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  通过设置 `User-Agent` 实现浏览器伪装，绕过基础的反爬检测。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  使用 `urllib.parse.quote` 对 URL 参数进行编码，解决中文参数传输问题。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握这三点，即可应对绝大多数简单的网页爬取需求。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在使用 Python 进行网络爬虫开发时，<code>urllib</code> 库是我们最常接触的基础库。很多初学者在使用 <code>urllib.request.urlopen</code> 时会发现：直接请求往往无法获取网页数据，或者被服务器重定向到登录页/错误页。</p>\n<p>这通常是因为我们忽略了 <strong>请求头</strong> 的设置。本文将深入讲解如何通过 <code>urllib</code> 定制请求对象，实现 UA 伪装，以及如何处理 URL 中的中文编码问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一、基础知识：URL-的组成与端口\"><a href=\"#一、基础知识：URL-的组成与端口\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、基础知识：URL 的组成与端口\"></a>一、基础知识：URL 的组成与端口</h2><p>在深入代码之前，我们需要理解 URL 的基本构成。一个完整的 URL 包含协议、主机、端口号、路径、参数和锚点。</p>\n<p>在爬虫请求中，<strong>端口号</strong> 往往决定了协议类型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">协议类型</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">默认端口</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>HTTP</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">80</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">超文本传输协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>HTTPS</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">443</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">安全套接字层超文本传输协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">MySQL</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">3306</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">数据库服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Redis</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">6379</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">缓存服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">MongoDB</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">27017</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">数据库服务端口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>我们在代码中指定的 <code>https://www.baidu.com</code>，浏览器实际上默认连接的是 <code>443</code> 端口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\"><a href=\"#二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？\"></a>二、痛点：为什么需要请求对象定制？</h2><p><code>urlopen</code> 方法虽然简单，但它只接受 URL 字符串或特定的 Request 对象。</p>\n<p>如果我们直接发起请求，<code>urllib</code> 发送的请求头中的 <code>User-Agent</code> 默认是 <code>Python-urllib/x.x</code>。绝大多数网站会识别出这是一个脚本请求，从而通过反爬机制直接拒绝访问。</p>\n<p><strong>核心问题</strong>：<code>urlopen</code> 方法本身不支持直接传递 <code>headers</code> 字典参数。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：使用 <code>urllib.request.Request</code> 类定制请求对象，将 URL 和 Headers 封装在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三、实战演练\"><a href=\"#三、实战演练\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、实战演练\"></a>三、实战演练</h2><h3 id=\"1-基础案例：添加-User-Agent-伪装\"><a href=\"#1-基础案例：添加-User-Agent-伪装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 基础案例：添加 User-Agent 伪装\"></a>1. 基础案例：添加 User-Agent 伪装</h3><p>下面的代码展示了如何创建一个包含自定义 Headers 的请求对象，成功访问百度首页。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 目标 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 这是一个标准的浏览器 User-Agent，用于伪装成 Chrome 浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36 Edge/16.16299&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 请求对象的定制</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 因为 urlopen 不支持直接传 headers 字典，所以需要先构建 Request 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 关键词传参：将 url 和 headers 封装进 request 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取并解码响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\">**代码解析**：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **headers 构建**：我们从浏览器开发者工具中复制真实的 User-Agent 字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **Request 对象**：通过 `urllib.request.Request` 将 URL 和 Headers 绑定。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **发送请求**：`urlopen` 接收的是定制好的 `request` 对象，而非单纯的 URL 字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. 进阶案例：URL 参数编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在实际爬虫中，我们经常需要搜索特定关键词（如中文）。URL 中如果包含中文或其他特殊字符，必须进行编码（Percent-encoding），否则会抛出错误或乱码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">`urllib.parse.quote` 方法可以将字符串转换为 URL 兼容的编码格式。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.parse</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 基础 URL，注意 &#x27;wd&#x27; 是百度的查询参数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 需要查询的关键词</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">keyword = <span class=\"string\">&quot;你好&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># URL 编码转换</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 将中文 &quot;你好&quot; 转换为 Unicode 编码格式 (例如: %E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">name = urllib.parse.quote(keyword)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;编码后的关键词: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;name&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 拼接完整的 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">full_url = base_url + name</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定制请求对象 (复用之前的 headers)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">request = urllib.request.Request(url=full_url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 发送请求并获取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = urllib.request.urlopen(request)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(content)</span><br><span class=\"line\">**关键点说明**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `urllib.parse.quote(<span class=\"string\">&quot;你好&quot;</span>)`：将中文字符转换为 `%xx` 形式，这是 HTTP 协议传输的标准要求。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `full_url` 拼接：在爬虫开发中，构建带参数的 URL 是最常见的操作之一。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了 `urllib` 库中请求对象定制的关键技术：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  使用 `urllib.request.Request` 封装 URL 和 Headers，解决 `urlopen` 无法携带请求头的问题。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  通过设置 `User-Agent` 实现浏览器伪装，绕过基础的反爬检测。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  使用 `urllib.parse.quote` 对 URL 参数进行编码，解决中文参数传输问题。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握这三点，即可应对绝大多数简单的网页爬取需求。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Python爬虫","path":"api/categories/Python爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"urllib","path":"api/tags/urllib.json"}]}